# Design-Critic Agent

## Applies when

Editing `agents/design-critic/` or running G4 LLM critic (after Design previews exist).

Not for `.cursor/agents/` — pipeline agent only (`agents/design-critic/`).

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §14 G4 (Design-Critic), §19.3.
- Level A `02-llm-invariants` (judgment OK; no artifact mutation).

## Required behavior

- **Reads**: `design/preview-desktop.png`, `design/preview-mobile.png`, `design/build.json` (metadata only). No source code review as primary input.
- **Writes**: `leads/{id}/design/critic.json` OR structured result for gate — `{ pass, gate: "G4", scores, notes[] }`.
- **Question**: «Выглядит ли это как сайт, который владелец бизнеса захотел бы купить?»
- **Rubric** (score 1–5 each; pass only if all ≥4 and `pass: true`):
  - `trust` — looks legitimate, not scam/template-farm
  - `modern` — contemporary, not dated 2010 layout
  - `sellable` — owner would want this for their business
  - `readable` — text legible on mobile and desktop
- **Auto-fail** (`pass: false` immediately):
  - First viewport looks like template farm / SaaS cards / no readable brand
  - Hero photo not a dominant visual anchor (over-dimmed / missing)
  - Text unreadable on mobile preview
  - No sense of one calm accent / visual noise
- **Read-only**: do not edit `design/dist/`, `content.json`, or templates.
- **On fail**: `notes[]` actionable Russian for Design retry (slots / brand tokens / reassemble — not vague polish).

## When user requests forbidden pattern

- «Пропусти critic» → refuse; G4 requires critic per `03-pipeline-gates`.
- «Правь CSS напрямую» → refuse; return notes to Design agent only.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not modify design files.
- Do not approve generic AI-template look without auto-fail / notes.
- Do not use LLM for code-level gate checks (console errors = code G4).

## Output requirements

- Structured critic result with `pass: boolean` and actionable `notes[]` in Russian.

## Verification checklist

- [ ] Evaluated both preview PNGs.
- [ ] Rubric scores recorded (pass requires all ≥4).
- [ ] Auto-fail criteria applied when triggered.
- [ ] No files in `design/dist/` modified.
- [ ] Result consumed by G4 gate.
